%description
The Tunnel Vision Laboratories fork of ANTLR 4, including its nullability
annotations, Java runtime, parser generator, and Maven plugins.

%package annotations
Summary: Runtime annotations for the Tunnel Vision ANTLR fork

Group: Development/Java

%description annotations
Nullability annotations and their annotation processor from the Tunnel Vision
Laboratories ANTLR 4 fork.

%package runtime
Summary: Java runtime for the Tunnel Vision ANTLR fork

Group: Development/Java

%description runtime
The Java runtime library used by parsers generated by the Tunnel Vision
Laboratories ANTLR 4 fork.

%package maven-plugin
Summary: Maven plugin for the Tunnel Vision ANTLR fork

Group: Development/Java

%description maven-plugin
The Maven plugin for generating parsers with the Tunnel Vision Laboratories
ANTLR 4 fork.

%package testgen-maven-plugin
Summary: Maven test generation plugin for the Tunnel Vision ANTLR fork

Group: Development/Java

